<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>SmartClinic — Supuni Dissanayake</title>
<meta name="description" content="SmartClinic: a full-stack clinic management platform with role-based access and a data-grounded AI assistant, built solo by Supuni Dissanayake." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #16222C;
    --ink-soft: #263442;
    --mist: #4A5A68;
    --mist-quiet: #7C8B98;
    --ground: #F5FAFC;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --surface-sunken: #EDF5F8;
    --border: #DCE9EF;
    --teal: #1D8AAE;
    --teal-strong: #146E8C;
    --teal-tint: #DEF2F7;
    --violet: #7B3FE4;
    --violet-tint: #EFE7FC;
    --good: #0E9C6F;
    --good-tint: #E1F7EE;
    --warn: #B5720A;
    --warn-tint: #FBF0DC;
    --bad: #D93646;
    --bad-tint: #FBE6E8;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(20,40,55,0.04), 0 8px 24px -12px rgba(20,40,55,0.14);
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --ink: #EAF3F7;
      --ink-soft: #CFE0E8;
      --mist: #9FB3C0;
      --mist-quiet: #718795;
      --ground: #0A121A;
      --surface: #101B24;
      --surface-sunken: #0D1821;
      --border: #1F313D;
      --teal: #6FD1EC;
      --teal-strong: #8FDCEF;
      --teal-tint: #143440;
      --violet: #B48CFF;
      --violet-tint: #241C3E;
      --good: #3FCE9E;
      --good-tint: #0F2A22;
      --warn: #E3A83E;
      --warn-tint: #2E2310;
      --bad: #F0778A;
      --bad-tint: #341920;
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 12px 32px -16px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --ink: #EAF3F7;
    --ink-soft: #CFE0E8;
    --mist: #9FB3C0;
    --mist-quiet: #718795;
    --ground: #0A121A;
    --surface: #101B24;
    --surface-sunken: #0D1821;
    --border: #1F313D;
    --teal: #6FD1EC;
    --teal-strong: #8FDCEF;
    --teal-tint: #143440;
    --violet: #B48CFF;
    --violet-tint: #241C3E;
    --good: #3FCE9E;
    --good-tint: #0F2A22;
    --warn: #E3A83E;
    --warn-tint: #2E2310;
    --bad: #F0778A;
    --bad-tint: #341920;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 12px 32px -16px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--ground);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: var(--teal-strong); }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--teal);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, .display {
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal-strong);
  }

  .num, .stat-value, .code-chip {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.86em;
    background: var(--surface-sunken);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 0.1em 0.42em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 84px 0 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -220px; right: -160px;
    width: 560px; height: 560px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--teal-tint) 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.9;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .brandmark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .brandmark .glyph {
    width: 34px; height: 34px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--teal-strong));
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: #fff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -4px rgba(29,138,174,0.5);
  }
  .brandmark .word {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 4.1rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--teal-strong);
  }
  .hero .lede {
    font-size: 1.14rem;
    color: var(--mist);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .chip {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 7px 13px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--mist);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .chip b { color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ECG divider */
  .ecg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 46px;
    display: block;
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .ecg path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .ecg .sweep {
    stroke-dasharray: 6 4000;
    animation: sweep 7s linear infinite;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ecg .sweep { animation: none; stroke-dasharray: none; }
  }
  @keyframes sweep {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 4000; }
    to   { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  }

  /* ---------- Vitals strip ---------- */
  .vitals {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .vital {
    padding: 22px 20px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .vital:first-child { border-left: none; }
  .vital .stat-value {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .vital .stat-label {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
  }

  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */
  section { padding: 76px 0; }
  section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }
  .section-head .eyebrow { display: block; }
  .section-num {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
  }

  .pull {
    font-family: 'Newsreader', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .role-note {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .role-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .role-card .who {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--teal-strong);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .role-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--mist); }

  /* ---------- Architecture split ---------- */
  .arch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .arch-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 26px 26px 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .arch-card .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .arch-card.fe .tag { background: var(--teal-tint); color: var(--teal-strong); }
  .arch-card.be .tag { background: var(--violet-tint); color: var(--violet); }
  .arch-card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .arch-card .stack {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .arch-card ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .arch-card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .arch-card li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0.55em;
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .arch-card.fe li::before { background: var(--teal); }
  .arch-card.be li::before { background: var(--violet); }

  /* permission matrix */
  .matrix-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; }
  table.matrix { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--surface); font-size: 0.87rem; min-width: 480px; }
  table.matrix th, table.matrix td { padding: 12px 16px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  table.matrix th {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
    background: var(--surface-sunken);
  }
  table.matrix tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  table.matrix td.module { color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 500; }
  .perm { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 500; }
  .perm.yes { color: var(--good); }
  .perm.no { color: var(--mist-quiet); }
  .perm.dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
  .perm.yes .perm.dot, .perm.yes::before { background: var(--good); }
  .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
  .dot.good { background: var(--good); }
  .dot.mute { background: var(--border); }

  /* ---------- Feature grid ---------- */
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
  }
  .feature-card .fhead {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .feature-card .ficon {
    width: 30px; height: 30px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--teal-tint);
    color: var(--teal-strong);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .feature-card h3 { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink); }
  .feature-card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .feature-card li { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--mist); margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .feature-card li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .feature-card.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .feature-card.ai {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--surface) 0%, var(--violet-tint) 340%);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .feature-card.ai .ficon { background: var(--violet-tint); color: var(--violet); }

  /* ---------- Case notes (engineering highlights) ---------- */
  .case {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 26px 0;
  }
  .case + .case { border-top: 1px dashed var(--border); }
  .case .tag2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
    padding-top: 3px;
  }
  .case h3 { font-size: 1.08rem; margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .case p { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .case p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .case .fix { color: var(--good); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer {
    padding: 48px 0 64px;
  }
  .foot-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .foot-row .who {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--mist);
  }
  .foot-row .who b { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .stackcloud {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
  }
  .stackcloud span {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--mist-quiet);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 99px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  .back-link {
    position: fixed;
    top: 18px;
    left: 18px;
    z-index: 50;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--teal-strong); }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .vitals { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .vital:nth-child(3) { border-left: none; }
    .arch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .role-note { flex-direction: column; }
    .case { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 56px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a class="back-link" href="/#projects">&larr; Portfolio</a>

<article>
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div class="brandmark">
      <span class="glyph">&#10010;</span>
      <span class="word">SMARTCLINIC — CASE STUDY</span>
    </div>
    <h1>A clinic runs on <em>trust</em> and <em>timing</em> — the software has to earn both.</h1>
    <p class="lede">SmartClinic is a full-stack practice-management platform I built solo: patient records, scheduling, consultations, prescriptions, and billing behind real role-based access, with an AI assistant grounded in the clinic's own data instead of a generic chatbot bolted on top.</p>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <span class="chip">👤 <b>Solo build</b> — frontend, backend, AI integration</span>
      <span class="chip">🩺 <b>Domain</b> — clinic / practice management</span>
      <span class="chip">🔐 <b>Auth</b> — JWT, role-based (Doctor / Receptionist)</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <svg class="ecg" viewBox="0 0 1000 46" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="beat" width="220" height="46" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M0,23 L60,23 L74,23 L84,4 L96,42 L106,14 L116,23 L220,23" />
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="1000" height="46" fill="url(#beat)" stroke="none" opacity="0.34" />
    <path class="sweep" d="M0,23 L60,23 L74,23 L84,4 L96,42 L106,14 L116,23 L220,23 L280,23 L294,23 L304,4 L316,42 L326,14 L336,23 L440,23 L500,23 L514,23 L524,4 L536,42 L546,14 L556,23 L660,23 L720,23 L734,23 L744,4 L756,42 L766,14 L776,23 L880,23 L940,23 L954,23 L964,4 L976,42 L986,14 L996,23 L1000,23" />
  </svg>

  <!-- Overview -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">01 — Overview</span><h2>Built for a two-person front desk.</h2></div>
      </div>
      <p class="pull">"Not every clinic needs an enterprise EMR — most need one system a doctor and a receptionist can both trust with different keys to the same door."</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>SmartClinic models a small private practice as it actually runs: one doctor handling consultations and prescriptions, one receptionist handling the front desk — patients, scheduling, and payments. Rather than a single flat permission model, the system encodes that split at the API layer, so the UI, the auth tokens, and the server all agree on who can do what.</p>
        <p>The stack is deliberately boring where it should be — Spring Boot and Postgres for data that has to be right — and a little adventurous where it pays off: a Gemini-backed assistant that answers questions like "what's pending today?" by querying the clinic's live records first, then handing that context to the model, rather than letting it guess.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-note">
        <div class="role-card"><div class="who">Doctor · ADMIN</div><p>Full clinical access — consultations, prescriptions, the AI assistant, and every front-desk function too.</p></div>
        <div class="role-card"><div class="who">Receptionist</div><p>Patients, appointments, and payments — plus read-only access to prescriptions to print for patients.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">02 — Architecture</span><h2>Two codebases, one contract.</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-grid">
        <div class="arch-card fe">
          <span class="tag">Frontend</span>
          <h3>Next.js App Router</h3>
          <p class="stack">Next.js 15 · React 19 · TypeScript</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Every authenticated page wraps a shared shell — sidebar, topbar, and a floating AI widget — with role-filtered navigation mirroring the server's rules</li>
            <li>Session lives in a JWT kept client-side; a thin fetch wrapper attaches it to every call and force-logs-out on a 401</li>
            <li>Role-first login: Doctor and Receptionist are distinct entry points, not a dropdown after the fact</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="arch-card be">
          <span class="tag">Backend</span>
          <h3>Spring Boot API</h3>
          <p class="stack">Java 17 · Spring Security · PostgreSQL</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Stateless JWT auth with BCrypt-hashed passwords; one <code>SecurityFilterChain</code> is the single source of truth for every route's access rule</li>
            <li>Seven JPA entities behind Spring Data repositories, schema kept in sync automatically as the domain model evolves</li>
            <li>A public, unauthenticated stats endpoint exposes clinic-wide counts only — never patient data — for the pre-login screen</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-wrap">
        <table class="matrix">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Module</th><th>Receptionist</th><th>Doctor</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="module">Patients — view, create, edit</td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">Patients — delete</td><td><span class="perm"><span class="dot mute"></span>No</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">Appointments &amp; payments</td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">Prescriptions — view / print</td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">Prescriptions — write</td><td><span class="perm"><span class="dot mute"></span>No</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">Consultations</td><td><span class="perm"><span class="dot mute"></span>No</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="module">AI assistant</td><td><span class="perm"><span class="dot mute"></span>No</span></td><td><span class="perm yes"><span class="dot good"></span>Yes</span></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

